window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><strong>Enter the explosive world of the blockbuster Shatter Me series by #1 <em>New York Times</em> bestselling author Tahereh Mafi!</strong></p><p>This audio bundle includes the first three books in the captivating series:</p><p><strong>SHATTER ME</strong>: A girl with the ability to kill with a single touch is held hostage as an evil regime called the Reestablishment tries to use her as a weapon.</p><p><strong>UNRAVEL ME</strong>: Juliette is free from the Reestablishment’s clutches, but is relentlessly pursued by one of its leaders, Warner, who’s immune to her deadly touch.</p><p><strong>IGNITE ME</strong>: To take down the Reestablishment once and for all, Juliette must decide whether she can risk trusting Warner—and whether she wants to trust him with more than just their mission.</p>"; 
